OL,3,GNEWSAPitlochry Town Hall to be sold to
OL,4,Acommunity for #1
OL,5,
OL,6,FPitlochry Town Hall will be sold to the
OL,7,Flocal community for #1 after
OL,8,Fcouncillors approved the move.
OL,10,FThe sale follows a consultation that
OL,11,Fsaw 96% of respondents back the
OL,12,FPitlochry Town Hall charity's community
OL,13,Fasset transfer request.
OL,15,FThe charity's chairman Duncan Tannahill
OL,16,Fdescribed the move as a "hugely
OL,17,Fsignificant milestone" in its journey
OL,18,Ftowards securing the future of the
OL,19,F126-year-old building.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
